// Relics: one-of-a-kind things a unit takes up as the prize for beating a monster (a lair's "prizes" in
// units.json, { "relic": id }), or finds in an old ruin (ruins.json). The nearest of the player's fighting
// units near the cleared den, without a relic already, takes it up. It keeps it when it evolves; when it
// dies it drops it where it fell, and any player's fighting unit without a relic that walks over it picks
// it up. A unit bears at most one.
//   hp: hit points added to the bearer's most (it gets them at once too)
//   damage: added to each of the bearer's hits
//   armor: added on every part of the bearer
//   web: { pace, time }: whom the bearer's blows land on walks at pace percent for time seconds
//   icon: the pixel icon (game/scripts/UiIcons.cs), by default the id
